- ORIFICE PLUG = THREE CORRECT LOOPS, WRONG VOLUME.
- ORIFICE-TRUE IR CHANNEL that policy treated as bucket-wobble-only as
  the tie-break.
- REVERSIBLE PROBE that recouples D50 iff the spray field is intact.
- TRIPLE-EDGE ELIGIBILITY: coordinated depression; pair rollback fails.
- CRITIC HEAD that can hold a process-correct MODIFY against a later
  unmonitored world loss without netting.

